# Keycloak realm imports (--import-realm). The sanitized, versioned `fairspot-realm.json`
# bootstrap IS committed (no users, no secrets, public/PKCE clients). Any operator-added
# realm export can contain client secrets / env-specific config, so it stays git-ignored
# and lives in the operator secret store (fairspot-platform), never here.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!fairspot-realm.json
